                                                "sense_id": "01c86480-f2c3-35c4-b37e-088fd1abbb28",
                                                "text": "1805–1814, Dante Alighieri, Henry Francis Cary (translator), The Divine Comedy, \"Inferno\", Canto VIII\nWe reach'd the lofty turret's base, our eyes / its height ascended, where we mark'd uphung / two cressets and another saw from far"
